Aggregate Functions

Aggregate functions are used to perform calculations on a column.

#Highest Value
print(df["Marks"].max())

#Lowest Value
print(df["Marks"].min())

#Average Value
print(df["Marks"].mean())

#Sum of Values
print(df["Marks"].sum())

#Count of Values
print(df["Marks"].count())

#index of max value
print(df["Marks"].argmax())  
